description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants [Instant ATB 1] & [Instant Cast 1] to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & 30% DEF/RES Pierce to Fire Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if user has at least Fire Damage +0/20%;
WS Blue: Grants [Fire Damage +50%] to user
WS Gold: Grants [During Tactical Awoken Mode, 50% DEF/RES Pierce & Quick Cast to Fire Abilities] to user

